{"id":"658078","name":"腐卷炖白菜","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658078/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"腐卷","amount":"300g"},{"name":"白菜","amount":"一颗"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"买的腐卷（里面包肉）、白菜、葱、蒜。","img":"images/658078/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"白菜切段。","img":"images/658078/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅热油，爆香蒜末。","img":"images/658078/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入白菜翻炒。","img":"images/658078/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"炒至变色，加少量盐调味。","img":"images/658078/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"转至砂锅，加入半碗水煮开。","img":"images/658078/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入腐卷，上盖小火炖十分钟。","img":"images/658078/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"接下来的时间，调一个酱汁，碗内放入黄豆酱、蚝油、酱油、淀粉。","img":"images/658078/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入小半碗水调匀。","img":"images/658078/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"时间到倒入酱汁。","img":"images/658078/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大火收汁。","img":"images/658078/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最后撒入葱花即可。","img":"images/658078/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658078/step_13.jpeg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}